                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "it just seems like the development is not there. the game is rigid and barely playable. but as a tank enthusaist, i feel the game, at least the idea, has potential, especially if it stays in a free state. The little bit i got to play before my oculus 2 crashed due to the game was actually kinda fun. the interior looked amazing, pretty identical to the Tiger. It seems like its got unique mechanics too it. The only issue is it just seems like the development is not there. The game is HELLA buggy, barely playable, and in my experience, crashed my VR equipment every time i played. But i still believe the idea has potential.",
